   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kosovo Property Agency</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Kosovo Property Agency</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">KPA (Kosovo Property Agency) grundades &#xe5;r 2006. Etableringen skedde under UNMIK:s f&#xf6;rordning 2006/10 och 2006/50 som en administrativ myndighet och &#xe4;mnar att fungera som en oberoende organ. Dess mandat bekr&#xe4;ftades i Ahtisaaris plan,vilken f&#xf6;reskrev KPA:s existens. Dess fr&#xe4;msta uppgift &#xe4;r att l&#xf6;sa privat&#xe4;gande mark-fr&#xe5;gan vilken sprang ur som en effekt av Kosovo-konflikten 1998-1999.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kosovo Property Agency (KPA) was formed in 2006.It is established under UNMIK Regulation 2006/10 and 2006/50 as an administrative agency which shall function as an independent body. Its mandate was reiterated in the Ahtisaari Plan, which stipulated the existence of KPA. It&apos;s main task is to resolve private immovable property claims arising out of the conflict in 1998-99.</narrative>
  </description>
